('d565d33d-a14e-43bc-b590-41df76bb2d10', 'Northzone', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Global multi-stage venture capital fund, investing from seed to growth', 'Northzone is a global multi-stage venture capital firm founded in 1996, investing from seed to growth in category-defining technology companies across Europe and the US. From offices in London, Stockholm, Amsterdam, Berlin and New York, it has raised ten funds, most recently the €1bn Northzone X (2022). Northzone was an early backer of companies such as Spotify, iZettle, Trustpilot, Kahoot! and Personio.', 'https://northzone.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/northzone/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2024/06/11/17e8368bb40dbd38f50b7fda5472754d.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/northzone', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.517414, -0.1396562, 1, 7575755, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Seed|Series A|Series B|Series C|Series E', 'Seed:5|Series A:3|Series B:3|Series C:1|Series E:1', 'Automotive|Analytics|Classifieds|Consumer Electronics|Apparel|Social|Social Media|Messaging|Security|Techstars 501 Investors|Wellness / Beauty|Medical / Healthcare|Insurance|Financial Service|Wearable', '2026-10', 380, 13),
