('0e565670-8b73-48c7-8b09-7a64b530da43', 'Venrex', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Early stage VC based in London', 'Venrex is a UK based venture capital fund that provides equity funding to startups and small businesses, with a focus on technology enabled companies within the consumer retail and fintech industries. Founded in 2003 by Tom Fleming, Venrex has invested in over 70 companies.', 'https://venrex.partners', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/venrex/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/10/27/3eb855c0c416f9d6f112594937b29788.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/venrex_investment_management', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.512375, -0.2188474, 378788, 1893939, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A|Series B', 'Seed:8|Series A:3|Series B:1', null, '2026-09', 152, 12),
