('b4e09c17-8672-471c-b14e-dd90da50c44c', '20VC', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Venture capital fund and podcast network focused on technology investing and startups.', '20VC is a venture capital firm that evolved from ''The Twenty Minute VC'' podcast, one of the largest media brands in venture capital. The firm was founded in 2020 by Harry Stebbings, who started the podcast in 2014 at the age of 18. Inspired by the film ''The Social Network,'' Stebbings began interviewing top venture capitalists and founders, growing the podcast to over 150 million downloads. The business operates as a media-driven venture capital firm, leveraging the podcast''s extensive network and insights for deal sourcing and investment decisions. 20VC manages several funds, starting with an $8.3 million fund in 2020 and growing significantly since. In June 2021, the firm raised $140 million for its second fund. More recently, in October 2024, 20VC announced its third fund, totaling over $360 million, a 2.5x increase from the previous one. This capital is divided between seed and Series A investments, targeting technology companies primarily in Europe and the US. The firm''s investment strategy focuses on various sectors, including enterprise applications, fintech, SaaS, AI, and digital health. A core differentiator for 20VC is its unique structure, which includes operator-led sub-funds: 20Sales, 20Growth, and 20Product. These sub-funds consist of experienced operators from high-profile tech companies who provide direct support to portfolio companies in their respective areas of expertise. This model is designed to add value beyond capital, helping startups with go-to-market…', 'https://thetwentyminutevc.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/20vc/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2024/08/05/8943d602d7051e07d0cdf770bc11f151.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/20vc', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.47903, -0.2206267, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A|Series B', 'Seed:5|Series A:3|Series B:3', null, '2026-10', 109, 11),
