('44079c71-7841-4adf-af40-ff0477f2db78', 'Business Growth Fund', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital|private_equity', 'organization', 'Helps Britain’s growing businesses by providing growth capital', 'BGF is the most active and influential investor in small and mid-sized businesses in the UK. An established and independent company, it has £2.5bn to support a range of growing companies – early stage, growth stage and quoted – across every region and sector of the economy. BGF is a minority, non-controlling equity partner with a patient outlook, based on shared long-term goals with the management teams it backs. With a 150+ strong team, BGF offers an unparalleled international network of business leaders, sector experts, board-level non-executives and provides in-house support with Chair and senior executive selection and appointments.', 'https://bgf.co.uk', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/1895032', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2018/06/11/3b7984482f04527a577ae05a0f0d978d.jpg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/business_growth_fund', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.508568, -0.1226398, 1893939, 7575755, 'GBP', 'GROWTH EQUITY', 'GROWTH EQUITY|Series A|Growth|Series B|Other|Series C|Series D', 'Series A:3|Growth:2|Series B:2|Other:1|Series C:1|Series D:1', 'B Corp', '2026-10', 602, 10),
