('64ff6eeb-18b1-4c12-87c7-f1f11d1a4117', 'Future Planet Capital', 'venture_capital', 'private_equity|venture_capital', 'organization', 'impact-led venture capital firm built to back innovative companies from the world’s top universities and research ecosystems.', 'Future Planet is a global venture capital and impact investor. Through a unique series of partnerships and relationships around the world''s top universities, we provide venture and growth investment to entrepreneurs and businesses profitably solving the world''s greatest challenges in Climate Change, Education, Health, Sustainable Growth & Security. We''ve established a network that affords an unrivalled level of access to technology and life science firms that emerge from academic institutions and the "clusters of innovation" that surround them. Our mission is not simply to deliver excellent returns but to create a lasting impact: by connecting the world''s largest investors with its best minds, we believe we can address the greatest challenges that humanity faces today. The Future Planet Fund has been designed in close conjunction with sophisticated investors in order to provide multi-stage access to start-ups, spin-outs and growing companies, at a scale large enough to suit major sovereign wealth funds and similar institutions.', 'https://futureplanetcapital.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/future-planet-capital', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2020/11/15/a2082f0e22434d4415f752529e154122.jpg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/futureplanetcapital', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.50643, -0.12721, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A|Pre-Seed', 'Seed:6|Series A:2|Pre-Seed:1', null, '2026-09', 309, 9),
