('22c973c3-30a8-4a4b-9377-df7078dc0640', 'Chalfen Ventures', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Chalfen Ventures is an early stage venture capital firm that backs software startups aiming to grow & dominate new and often unusual markets', 'Chalfen Ventures is Mike Chalfen''s VC firm. Mike backs software startups aiming to grow and dominate new and often unusual markets. Investing from day 1 through series A, Chalfen Ventures often leads rounds, but is always flexible - to help create the best possible syndicate for each company. Mike operates as a solo VC, with no distractions from working closely with the entrepreneurs who have chosen him. Current investments: 5mins, Amenitiz, Assaia, AtomicJar, Bridebook, Bryter, Cutr, Flexciton, General Index, Harbr, Honu, Kraaft, Levity, Lokalise, Luminovo, Lynceus, Nous, Octeract, Oden, Opply, Reveal, Sedna, Snyk, Syntasso, Time is Ltd, Translucent, Vault, Worldover, Zaptic', 'https://chalfenventures.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/chalfen-ventures/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2023/04/18/83fe9014894ba37ce2b564e3f187fe8c.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/chalfen_ventures', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.51056, -0.2108338, null, null, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Seed|Series A|Series B', 'Seed:3|Series A:3|Series B:2', null, '2026-10', 39, 8),
