('0f65e6c1-58e5-42da-b892-e302994234cb', 'Puma Growth Partners', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital|private_equity', 'organization', 'Formerly Puma Private Equity. Driving scalable growth through capital and expertise in UK scale-up businesses', 'Puma Growth Partners is the private equity division of Puma Capital Group, focusing on investing in scale-up businesses across the UK. Operating from offices in London, Manchester, and Edinburgh, the firm provides capital and expertise to drive transformational change and enable scalable growth. Puma Growth Partners targets businesses that are poised for significant expansion, offering not just financial backing but also strategic partnership to help management teams achieve their growth objectives. The firm is particularly active in regions outside of London, recognizing the burgeoning scale-up ecosystem in areas like the North of England and Scotland. By setting up dedicated investment teams in these regions, Puma Growth Partners aims to capitalize on the unique opportunities presented by these markets. The business model revolves around identifying promising companies, investing in them, and adding value through strategic guidance and operational support. This approach not only helps the portfolio companies grow but also generates returns for Puma Growth Partners. The firm serves a diverse range of clients, primarily focusing on businesses that have demonstrated potential for rapid growth and require additional resources to scale effectively. Keywords: private equity, scale-up, investment, capital, expertise, UK, growth, partnership, transformation, regional.', 'https://pumagrowthpartners.co.uk', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/puma-growth-partners/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/02/04/04813170fc783bc7237781d077bef81a.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/puma_growth_partners', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.5072, -0.140053, null, null, 'GBP', 'GROWTH EQUITY VC', 'GROWTH EQUITY VC