('5d6bb0fd-1fe1-4a66-9fed-c7ce13a46f7f', '24Haymarket', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', '24Haymarket focuses on growth equity and venture capital investments in the UK', '24 Haymarket is a partnership of 12 senior former private equity, mezzanine and debt professionals with a number of successful portfolio company CEOs. Their aim is to provide equity finance to fast growing small companies in the UK and Continental Europe. 24 Haymarket partners invest their own capital and are therefore able to make quick decisions. They are looking for businesses where they can use extensive contact base and collective experience to add value to a business and help its management teams achieve its strategic ambitions.', 'https://24haymarket.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/24haymarket/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2019/06/04/e5cad5e31817fc709dfa1e61ca78f395.jpeg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/24haymarket', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.508713, -0.1319152, 378788, 3787877, 'GBP', 'EARLY VC', 'EARLY VC|Seed|Series A|Other', 'Seed:3|Series A:2|Other:1', null, '2026-07', 89, 6),
