('5d9c55fb-99c6-4321-a2c7-f668e518f66a', 'PXN Group', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Two of the North’s best fund managers, Par Equity & Praetura, combining to deliver world-class investment programmes at scale and help build the Northern economy', 'PXN is the resulting entity from the merger of two Northern investment firms, Par Equity and Praetura Ventures, set to launch in 2025 pending FCA authorisation. The firm positions itself as a specialized investment manager with a geographical focus on the North of England, Northern Ireland, and Scotland. Its primary objective is to foster economic development in these regions by providing capital and support to high-growth companies. The business model centers on managing multiple funds to invest across various stages of a company''s lifecycle, specifically from Pre-seed to Series B rounds. This strategy allows PXN to support disruptive founders from their initial steps through to scaling their operations. The firm serves a client base that includes founders seeking capital, as well as advisers, investors, and institutions looking for exposure to the Northern UK''s venture ecosystem. In addition to its venture capital activities, PXN has a distinct focus on sustainable investments. It manages investments in nature-based solutions aimed at addressing climate change, while also targeting attractive financial returns for its investors. This dual-mandate approach combines economic development with environmental impact, aiming to deliver diversified and resilient portfolios. Keywords: investment management, venture capital, Pre-seed, Series B, Northern UK, nature-based solutions, fund manager, economic development, climate finance, portfolio diversification', 'https://pxngroup.com', null, 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/06/23/76f0104403347efeb6b08b8322690c57.jpg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/pxn_group', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.507446, -0.1277653, null, null, 'GBP', 'EARLY VC', 'EARLY VC|Seed|Series A|Series B', 'Seed:2|Series A:2|Series B:1', 'Alternative Investments|Investing in Startups|Climate Fintech', '2026-10', 419, 5),
('d811f7d1-1b3c-4468-8ad1-c6f114ffe4a2', 'DN Capital', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Early stage and growth capital investor focused on Seed, Series A and select series B investments in software, fintech, marketplace and consumer internet companies', 'DN Capital''s objective is to identify, invest in and actively support leading digital media, e-commerce, software and mobile applications companies on a global basis', 'https://dncapital.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/dn-capital', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2015/05/04/cdd9f83423ec213d03e629baf579275b.jpg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/dn_capital', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.500805, -0.13187031, 189394, 18939386, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Series B|Seed|Series A', 'Series B:3|Seed:1|Series A:1', 'Analytics|Consumer Electronics|Apparel|Social|Social Media|Messaging|Security|Biotechnology|Techstars 501 Investors|Medical / Healthcare|Insurance|Wearable', '2026-07', 301, 5),
('86b1cde6-a5ab-4f2a-ae17-6fdedab27e03', 'Parkwalk Advisors', 'venture_capital', 'private_equity|venture_capital', 'organization', 'Investment management firm focused on UK-based technology companies spun out of UK universities or research institutes', 'Parkwalk is one of the UK’s leading growth fund managers backing world-changing technologies emerging out of UK universities and research institutions with the aim of delivering world-class returns. We back high potential, hard science technology companies that aim to shape the future by commercialising innovation in sectors of strategic importance to UK Plc, such as AI, big data, life science, materials, cleantech, future of mobility, medtech and quantum computing. Parkwalk currently has over £250m of assets under management. We have invested in over 100 companies across our managed funds, including funds managed in conjunction with the universities of Oxford, Cambridge and Bristol. In 2017 Parkwalk joined forces with IP Group plc, a FTSE 250 listed company.', 'https://parkwalkadvisors.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/park-walk-advisors', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2017/02/04/5a6ebbc660c1916314219d95c0d9a2c6.jpg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/parkwalk_advisors_ltd', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.532284, -0.1251563, null, null, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Series A|Seed', 'Series A:3|Seed:2', 'Investing', '2026-09', 223, 5),
