('546ebce5-7481-4ae4-bb05-85f5d4d98350', 'Kadmos Capital', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Early stage investments in deep tech and impactful technologies', 'Kadmos Capital is a London-based venture capital firm focused on early-stage investments in deep tech and impactful technologies. The firm is a UK onshore asset manager, FCA registered as an Authorized Person permitted under FSMA to manage and operate collective investment schemes under an EuVECA license (FRN 954103), focused on early-stage companies with hyper growth potential and positive impact. Kadmos is inspired by those seeking solutions to humanity''s most pressing problems, and backs high-impact, deep-tech founders at the intersection of science, technology and ambition, across AI & data, techbio and sustainability. Its portfolio spans generative AI infrastructure, AI-driven drug discovery and diagnostics, and climate and sustainability hardware and software.', 'https://kadmoscapital.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/kadmos-capital/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/10/26/c2b4becec449c730fb965bbaf76b102a.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/kadmoscapital', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.507446, -0.1277653, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A', 'Seed:2|Series A:2', null, '2026-09', 28, 4),
