('43455089-0bb2-470d-bcee-aa09695fd7de', 'Evantic Capital', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Investment fund backing B2B and AI startups across Europe and North America', 'Evantic Capital is a venture capital firm established in March 2023 by Matt Miller, a former partner at Sequoia Capital. The firm focuses on B2B investments in the European technology sector. Miller, who previously led Sequoia''s European operations, has successfully raised $355 million for Evantic''s inaugural fund, with Sequoia Capital itself being a key investor. This new venture is one of the largest solo VC funds in Europe. The firm''s investment strategy is centered on identifying and supporting promising early-stage B2B startups across Europe. Evantic Capital aims to leverage Miller''s extensive experience and network to provide not only capital but also strategic guidance to its portfolio companies. Keywords: venture capital, B2B investments, European startups, tech funding, early-stage investing, solo VC fund, Sequoia Capital, Matt Miller, enterprise software, financial services.', 'https://evantic.ai', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/evantic-capital/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/10/26/f06b7cc542dfa137ef5ed981114c667a.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/evantic_capital', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.507446, -0.1277653, null, null, 'GBP', 'SERIES C', 'SERIES C|Seed|Series A|Series B|Series D', 'Seed:1|Series A:1|Series B:1|Series D:1', 'Alternative Investments|Investing in Startups', '2026-09', 19, 4),
