('48a5339e-20e2-4e97-bc76-f8601bdf28c1', 'Vitruvian Partners', 'venture_capital', 'private_equity|venture_capital', 'organization', 'European growth buyouts and growth capital investments', 'Vitruvian Partners is an independent private equity firm that specialises in middle-market buyouts, growth buyouts and growth capital investments in the UK and elsewhere in Northern Europe. Vitruvius, the Roman architect and engineer, believed that balance, symmetry and proportionality form the basis of great architecture. Vitruvian Partners believes that a balanced perspective is required for success in private equity. We seek to create a perfect balance between the critical factors required to build outstanding businesses and to generate superior investment returns. Our experience as principals in the industry dates back to 1990 and demonstrates an ability to invest successfully over multiple market cycles throughout a spectrum of industries.', 'https://vitruvianpartners.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/vitruvian-partners-llp', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2015/05/04/fb1f74029879b6f5cfa63f94b677c454.jpg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/vitruvian_partners', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.51527, -0.15401095, 15151509, 151515091, 'GBP', 'GROWTH EQUITY', 'GROWTH EQUITY|Growth|Series F+', 'Growth:2|Series F+:1', 'Telecommunications|Health Care|Medical & Healthcare|Media Production', '2026-09', 103, 3),
