('675b045e-4ffe-4e0c-9ce4-96fbd7d7808a', 'UKTV Ventures', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', null, 'UKTV has been at the forefront of branded television for over 25 years, entertaining the nation with programmes they love. Its leading brands - Dave, Gold, W, Drama, Alibi, Eden and Yesterday - span comedy, entertainment, natural history, factual and scripted drama, and are delivered to audiences through UKTV Play, Freeview, Sky, Virgin Media, BT, TalkTalk, YouView, Freesat and Amazon Fire. The broadcaster is a significant investor in British creativity and is committed to working with new and established writers, directors, and programme-makers. corporate.uktv.co.uk | press.uktv.co.uk | @uktvpress Our Purpose We are UKTV. We are here to create TV with personality. In a world where ‘finding something to watch’ means searching endless streams of automated sameness, we believe in creating TV experiences with more personality, that champions diversity of talent both on & off screen. We are here to bring you a more personal type of TV: Channels and services that get you, with programmes that are hand-picked for their quality and available on any device - all crafted by fans for fans. Our Mission We are a different kind of broadcaster. One that’s on a mission to become the UK’s most successful non-PSB network. The place that fans turn to first for the genres they love. Admired in our industry as the feisty challenger. Powered by brilliant ideas not blockbuster budgets, we’ll push ourselves to build even more engaging brands, to create and curate more imaginative programmes to for…', 'https://uktvventures.co.uk', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/uktv/about/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2023/01/23/96427f8764a4799fce3daa58ff05a449.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/uktv_ventures', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.493835, -0.22546087, null, null, 'GBP', 'MEDIA FOR EQUITY', 'MEDIA FOR EQUITY|Other|Seed', 'Other:2|Seed:1', 