('b2c8f3b9-ca8f-405a-923f-8025cd40f341', 'Giant Ventures', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Giant backs purpose-driven founders building companies that matter', 'Giant backs purpose-driven technology founders solving the world’s biggest challenges. We champion entrepreneurs creating a more sustainable, equitable and resilient planet. Giant Ventures is a multi-stage, thesis driven firm seeking systemic change across four themes: • Environment • Cities • Health & Wellbeing • Financial Inclusion We value courage, persistence, creativity, and global ambition. Our offices are in London, LA and Denmark but we believe talent is everywhere. As former founders, we know how hard it is to create something from nothing. We roll up our sleeves to help Giant founders win.', 'https://giant.vc', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/giantventures/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/03/10/a04d4567fcebf48cdb48e608f156963c.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/giant_ventures', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.507336, -0.12765, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A', 'Seed:1|Series A:1', null, '2026-10', 75, 2)
