('51529e99-afb3-4c5c-b455-f69143bd66bd', 'Climate Investment', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Climate Investment (CI) is an independently managed specialist investor that invests in decarbonization technologies that underpin the next generation of global infrastructure. CI manages $1.8bn of total committed capital between its venture and growth strategies focused on decarbonization of energy, industry, transport and built environment, to drive market adoption, create value for infrastruct…', 'OGCI Climate Investments manages a US$1B+ fund focused on driving substantial reduction in carbon emissions by investing in technologies and projects that lower methane or carbon dioxide emissions or capture and store carbon dioxide. OGCI Climate Investments was launched in 2016 by the Oil and Gas Climate Initiative, a CEO-led initiative of 12 global oil and gas companies accounting for 30% of global operated production that aims to lead the industry response to climate change. At OGCI Climate Investments, we seek to accelerate global implementation of low carbon solutions across the energy, industrial, buildings and commercial transport sectors by collaborating with OGCI members, governments, customers and co-investors. Since inception, we have invested in 23 technologies and projects. Please join us in investing, building businesses and supporting demand creation. contact@ogci.com', 'https://climateinvestment.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/climate-investment/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/07/11/7044b11a486019b35ab2c22b2c495848.jpeg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/ogci_climate_investments', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.51487, -0.1411224, null, null, 'GBP', 'SERIES B', 'SERIES B|Series A|Series B', 'Series A:1|Series B:1', null, '2026-10', 69, 2),
