('29addc37-49d2-4c88-85b7-19d953c70169', 'Apis Partners', 'venture_capital', 'private_equity|venture_capital', 'organization', 'A private equity asset manager focused on Financial Services in Growth Market', 'Apis Partners is an ESGI-native global private equity asset manager that supports growth stage financial services and financial infrastructure businesses by providing them with catalytic growth equity capital. Apis, through its team of over 30 professionals and staff with deep industry expertise, manages total committed capital from investors (including drawn and invested capital) of ca. $1.3 billion. Including its headquarters in London, Apis has representation in seven countries across Europe, North, East and West Africa and South and Southeast Asia. Responsible investing and financial inclusion are the cornerstones of Apis’ investment philosophy, with the firm incorporating ESG requirements into investment analysis and decision-making processes, policies and practices. Apis is a signatory to the UN Principles for Responsible Investment.', 'https://apis.pe', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/apis-partners', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2017/07/14/b4e9d64cae12fac81abf92bffc187656.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/apis_partners', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.507446, -0.1277653, null, null, 'GBP', 'GROWTH EQUITY VC', 'GROWTH EQUITY VC|Growth|Series D', 'Growth:1|Series D:1', 'Equity Research', '2026-06', 42, 2),
