('cf960b9d-d642-4f19-b530-090bada0d194', 'Green Angel Ventures', 'angel_fund', 'angel_fund', 'organization', 'Early stage investor for UK climate innovation', 'The Climate Change Fund is a co-investment fund investing in the deals managed by Green Angel Syndicate. The Climate Change Fund supports the deals invested in by Green Angel Syndicate, drawing on the specialist expertise of the Syndicate’s 350+ members and using the same high standards of due diligence. The Fund is overseen by specialists with depth and breadth of knowledge on climate change, innovation and investment. Risk Disclaimer The Green Angel Syndicate Climate Change Fund is an EIS and SEIS fund which raises money for early-stage businesses by investing in EIS or SEIS eligible ventures with the aim of returning a profit for investors in the Fund. This product may place capital at risk and therefore Investors may not get back the full amount invested. Investment in early-stage companies involves risks such as illiquidity, lack of dividends, loss of investment and dilution. Investment in EIS and SEIS funds should be considered only as part of a diversified portfolio. There is no assurance that the investment objectives of any investment product will be achieved or that the strategies and methods described will be successful. Past performance is not necessarily a guide to future performance and the value of an investment may go down as well as up. Don’t invest unless you’re prepared to lose all your money invested. This is a high‑risk investment. You could lose all the money you invest and are unlikely to be protected if something goes wrong.', 'https://greenangelventures.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/green-angel-ventures/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2023/11/24/5199daaa242c2eca9200d1781a21808e.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/green_angel_ventures', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.464405, -0.22064549, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A|Pre-See