('fda84127-6498-4866-98ea-c894b79bd90e', 'Thomas Wolf', 'angel', 'angel', 'person', 'Hugging Face co-founder and CSO championing open-source AI', 'Thomas Wolf is the co-founder and Chief Science Officer of Hugging Face, where he has driven the company''s open-source and open-science efforts. He was central to creating the widely used Transformers library, along with Datasets, Diffusers and other tools that made state-of-the-art AI broadly accessible. He has championed open-science initiatives such as the BigScience workshop, which produced the BLOOM model, and FineWeb. A co-author of the O''Reilly book ''Natural Language Processing with Transformers'', he was previously a European patent attorney before entering AI.', null, 'https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomas-wolf-a056857/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/07/28/103b830848047399a6ee21591e06c416.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/people/thomas_wolf_1', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.507446, -0.1277653, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A', 'Seed:3|Series A:2', null, '2026-10', 41, 5),
