('1fc9be32-9158-487e-8079-cd322dd7d5b4', 'JamJar Investments', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Consumer tech focussed VC fund run by the innocent drinks founders', 'We are JamJar. The Consumer Venture Capital fund run by the innocent drinks founders. Our mission is simple: help entrepreneurs be successful with consumers. We invest in strong teams, with a digital/offline product consumers love. We look to invest in Seed / Series A of high growth consumer brand businesses in both digital and non-tech. We want to help disruptive businesses that can transform or dominate an industry.', 'https://jamjarinvestments.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/jamjar-investments', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2022/07/27/6a43daa520c1cdd8737a0a3dc7b50d98.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/jamjar_investments', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.49972, -0.30991015, 37879, 757575, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed|Series A|Series B', 'Seed:2|Series A:1|Series B:1', 'Consumer Goods|Automotive|Aerospace|PaaS|Analytics|Music|Consumer Electronics|Apparel|Social|Social Media|Security|Techstars 501 Investors|Wellness / Beauty|Medical / Healthcare|Wearable|Life sciences', '2026-10', 115, 9),
