('9cc501fe-1aa6-42ee-a660-4660077ae8c7', 'Creandum', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'European firm specializing in early-stage investments', 'Creandum is a pan-European early-stage venture firm founded in 2003, with offices in Stockholm, Berlin, London and San Francisco. The firm invests in consumer, software and hardware companies from seed through early growth, and manages flagship funds Creandum I–VII (Fund VII closed at €500m in 2024) plus Select vehicles. Its portfolio of 150+ companies includes Spotify, Klarna, Trade Republic, Bolt, Pleo, Kahoot and Lovable. Creandum backs founders building category-defining technology companies across Europe and beyond.', 'https://creandum.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/creandum/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/07/23/2038582e355b86a9a977818037591f6f.jpeg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/creandum', 'Stockholms kommun', 'Sweden', 59.32512, 18.071093, 151515, 5681816, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Series B|Series A', 'Series B:2|Series A:1', 'Life sciences|Aerospace|Analytics|Consumer Electronics|Apparel|SaaS|Social Media|Messaging|Security|On-Demand|Techstars 501 Investors|Medical / Healthcare|Insurance', '2026-10', 350, 3),
