('c907cf53-e181-4d47-9883-f30dd58676d0', 'Notion Capital', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'London-based early-stage venture capital firm investing in European business software companies', 'Notion is an early stage investor in European enterprise tech, SaaS and Cloud. We are here to create the conditions for extraordinary success with the entrepreneur at the centre. We want to help European tech companies fulfil their potential and achieve massive scale. We invest early when we can build strong relationships and help to shape the future success of our companies. Within our portfolio and beyond, we are building a thriving ecosystem that connects and recycles enterprise tech talent, ambition, knowledge, resources and of course money to support generations of entrepreneurs and help them create enterprise tech companies that scale.', 'https://notioncapital.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/notion-capital/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2018/05/21/a3dac0b41ed5bfd125c51d99f6b33599.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/notion_capital', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.51798, -0.1481564, 151515, 1893939, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Seed|Series A|Series B', 'Seed:1|Series A:1|Series B:1', 'Information Technology|Analytics|Consumer Electronics|SaaS|Social Media|Messaging|Security|CRM|Techstars 501 Investors|Wellness / Beauty|Life sciences', '2026-10', 272, 29),
