('86b1cde6-a5ab-4f2a-ae17-6fdedab27e03', 'Parkwalk Advisors', 'venture_capital', 'private_equity|venture_capital', 'organization', 'Investment management firm focused on UK-based technology companies spun out of UK universities or research institutes', 'Parkwalk is one of the UK’s leading growth fund managers backing world-changing technologies emerging out of UK universities and research institutions with the aim of delivering world-class returns. We back high potential, hard science technology companies that aim to shape the future by commercialising innovation in sectors of strategic importance to UK Plc, such as AI, big data, life science, materials, cleantech, future of mobility, medtech and quantum computing. Parkwalk currently has over £250m of assets under management. We have invested in over 100 companies across our managed funds, including funds managed in conjunction with the universities of Oxford, Cambridge and Bristol. In 2017 Parkwalk joined forces with IP Group plc, a FTSE 250 listed company.', 'https://parkwalkadvisors.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/park-walk-advisors', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2017/02/04/5a6ebbc660c1916314219d95c0d9a2c6.jpg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/parkwalk_advisors_ltd', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.532284, -0.1251563, null, null, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Series A|Seed', 'Series A:2|Seed:1', 'Investing|Life sciences', '2026-09', 223, 5),
('475e1cb1-cc85-4ad0-a0ec-06bb2d8247de', 'Haatch', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Pre-seed to Seed Investors made up of exited-Founders, building the fund we needed at the earliest stage of our businesses', 'Haatch menu Home Team Active Portfolio Lets Talk Blog Stamford Hot Desks WE INVEST IN COOL DIGITAL STARTUPS SaaS, Retail Mobile UK US WE INVEST IN COOL DIGITAL STARTUPS SaaS, Retail Mobile UK US Investment Philosophy Founded in September 2013, were an early stage investment business backing fantastic entrepreneurs who build disruptive, game changing startups. Our core focus is within the SaaS, Retail Mobile verticals however were always on the lookout for the next opportunity. Disruptive Startups Weve invested in 8 disruptive startups based in Stamford, London, Dublin, New York San Francisco. VIEW OUR PORTFOLIO Experienced Team We are an experienced team of entrepreneurs technologists who add value knowledge to every investment. MEET US Experienced Team We are an experienced team of entrepreneurs technologists who add value knowledge to every investment. MEET US PEOPLE, IDEAS EXECUTION Bright people. The founders of our startups range from designers to technologists to serial entrepreneurs. The first thing we look for in a business is a fantastic team. Brilliant ideas. We spend time getting to know each business and market in fine detail. Were looking for everything from competition, to market timing to scalability. Better execution. Our startups execute, write code and land customers in new and innovative ways. Restless Innovation Speed to Market ensures were always ahead. MONTHS OLD STARTUPS BACKED JOBS CREATED FUNDRAISING ROUNDS 36 MONTHS OLD 8 STARTUPS BACKED 80 JOBS CRE…', 'https://haatch.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/haatch', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2016/12/11/1abe13f9061fab26b1cb40022bf9e9c7.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/haatch', 'Stamford', 'United Kingdom', 52.651554, -0.474