('ebb76383-130c-4d39-8f48-068c55b860f7', 'Syndicate Room', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Data-driven venture fund building portfolios across Britain''s startup ecosystem', 'SyndicateRoom is a UK-based investment platform that offers a diversified Enterprise Investment Scheme (EIS) fund. The company leverages data to track and invest in promising startups alongside some of the UK''s top angel investors. SyndicateRoom primarily serves individual investors looking to gain exposure to high-growth startups while benefiting from the tax advantages of EIS. The platform operates in the venture capital market, focusing on early-stage companies with high growth potential. SyndicateRoom''s business model involves pooling funds from multiple investors to create a diversified portfolio of startups, thereby spreading risk and increasing the potential for high returns. The company makes money through management fees and a share of the profits from successful investments. SyndicateRoom has a portfolio of 220 companies and a membership base of 30,000 investors. The platform aims to provide transparent and honest investment opportunities, helping investors navigate the high-risk, high-reward world of startup investing. Keywords: EIS fund, UK startups, angel investors, venture capital, high returns, diversified portfolio, early-stage companies, tax advantages, investment platform, high-growth potential.', 'https://syndicateroom.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/syndicate-room', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/10/01/fe3313bb2e48cd140a04e9efeea2d9d3.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/syndicate_room', 'Cambridge', 'United Kingdom', 52.203514, 0.1317506, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed', 'Seed:3', 'Life sciences|Risk Management|Crowdfunding|Corporate Finance|Alternative Investments|Investing in Startups|deal execution', '2026-10', 126, 3),
