('9a503b20-8566-452a-80b3-eb97ac6a1149', 'The Conduit Connect', 'venture_capital', 'private_equity|venture_capital', 'organization', null, 'The Conduit Connect sources and connects the most promising high growth impact investing opportunities to mission aligned investors. We review hundreds of impact deals per year to select the most sustainable and investable opportunities with environmental and social impact at their core. Eligible companies and funds are offered a dedicated team that introduces them to values-aligned investors and mentors, a private digital platform that publishes these investment opportunities for Professional Investors and showcase events that are aimed to raise the profile and visibility of these businesses.', 'https://theconduitconnect.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/conduit-connect/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2023/01/16/9c6ddeb53a68d66cb65bf75716d97245.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/the_conduit_connect', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.51252, -0.14122596, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed', 'Seed:3', 'Life sciences', '2026-10', 20, 6),
