('1c586454-f082-400a-a962-6bf5bfb222ef', 'Accel', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Venture capital firm investing from seed to growth', 'Accel is a global venture capital firm that partners with founders from the earliest stages through all phases of private company growth. It often writes the first institutional check, leading seed and Series A rounds, and keeps backing companies in later rounds through its growth and Leaders funds. It also runs Atoms, a pre-seed programme for very early founders. The firm invests mainly in technology companies across AI, enterprise and infrastructure software, cloud and SaaS, cybersecurity, fintech and consumer internet. Teams in the Bay Area (Palo Alto and San Francisco), London and Bangalore cover the United States, Europe and Israel, and India, each with its own funds and market-specific strategy. Accel manages funds raised from institutional limited partners and earns returns when portfolio companies grow, go public or are acquired. Its portfolio includes Atlassian, CrowdStrike, Dropbox, Flipkart, Freshworks, Slack, Spotify, Swiggy and UiPath, as well as newer companies such as Lovable, Legora, Synthesia and Cognition. keywords: venture capital, seed, series a, growth equity, artificial intelligence, enterprise software, saas, cybersecurity, fintech, consumer internet, india, europe, israel', 'https://accel.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/accel-vc/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/01/08/443f8ab06ed18743830ad30829c6c0a4.jpeg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/accel_partners', 'Palo Alto', 'United States', 37.448357, -122.15903, 757575, 75757545, 'GBP', 'SERIES A', 'SERIES A|Seed|Series A', 'Seed:1|Series A:1', 'Life sciences|Infrastructure Services|Analytics|Cloud Services|Techstars 501 Investors', '2026-10', 2379, 2),
