('bcc045fb-8992-4822-bda7-1cf7cf5a9bff', 'Eight Roads Ventures', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'A venture capital fund with offices in China, India, Japan and the UK', 'Fidelity Growth Partners is a growth technology investor with $1b in assets under management globally and a £100m fund dedicated for Europe. We provide entrepreneurs with aspiration for greatness with the expertise, resources and connections needed to take their businesses further, faster. With Fidelity as our primary provider of capital, we have the ability to access resources that make us a proven and powerful partner for companies just entering the market as well as those ready for the next phase of growth. Some of our past and current investments include Curam Software (IBM), Newbay (RIMM), Innogames, notonthehighstreet, GoodData, Neo Technologies, Stylistpick, Wahanda, and Seatwave.', 'https://eightroads.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/eight-roads', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2024/09/12/3377d0ec7e0e956bedb231c03722f6be.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/eight_roads_ventures', null, 'Bermuda', null, null, 3787877, 37878773, 'GBP', 'SERIES B', 'SERIES B|Series A|Series B', 'Series A:1|Series B:1', 'Life sciences|Automotive|PaaS|Analytics|Music|Consumer Electronics|Apparel|SaaS|Social|Social Media|Messaging|Security|Techstars 501 Investors|Wellness / Beauty|Medical / Healthcare|Insurance|Capital Market|Wearable', '2026-08', 457, 2),
