('f4076f05-06c7-45c0-951d-501cdd9c0ebd', 'Breega', 'venture_capital', 'venture_capital', 'organization', 'Founder-led VC backing European and African tech startups', 'Breega is a venture capital firm that invests in technology startups across Europe and Africa, from pre-seed to Series A and beyond. Its partners are former founders and operators, working from main offices in Paris and London and with partners in other European and African tech hubs. It invests through seed funds for European startups, a venture fund for Series A and Series B rounds, and Breega Africa Seed, a pre-seed and seed fund for African startups. The funds are raised from institutional investors. Breega is sector agnostic and backs digital, climate and deep tech companies, such as fintech, enterprise software, healthtech, quantum computing and robotics. Portfolio companies include Exotec, Alice & Bob, Moneybox, Griffin and 011h. Breega usually leads or co-leads rounds and takes a board seat. Alongside capital, its in-house Scaling Squad works with founders on strategy, growth, hiring, brand, financial structuring and ESG. keywords: venture capital, seed, Series A, Europe, Africa, fintech, climate tech, deep tech, B Corp', 'https://breega.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/breega/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/02/28/35a88e2ffd503560d585ed312caa38ae.jpeg', 'https://app.dealroom.co/investors/breega', 'Paris', 'France', 48.866035, 2.3519628, null, null, 'GBP', 'SEED', 'SEED|Seed', 'Seed:2', 'Life sciences|B Corp', '2026-10', 139, 2),
