('27076bf2-90b3-4516-9abe-53622853c486', 'Voy', 'Aims to improve the daily lives of men by encouraging men to take control of their happiness and health and talk openly', 'Voy (formerly Manual.co) offers a comprehensive weight loss program that integrates personalised coaching and medication to help individuals achieve sustainable weight loss. The program is designed for those who have struggled with traditional diet and exercise methods, providing a tailored approach that addresses both physical and emotional aspects of eating. Clients begin their journey with an online assessment to determine the most suitable treatment plan, followed by discreet delivery of prescribed medication and regular coaching sessions to track progress and reshape habits. The business primarily serves individuals seeking long-term weight management solutions, leveraging a subscription-based model to generate revenue. By focusing on personalized care and continuous support, Voy aims to enhance client outcomes, with participants reportedly losing five times more weight compared to diet and exercise alone. The program also addresses emotional eating, offering strategies to manage it effectively. Keywords: weight loss, personalized program, medication, coaching, sustainable results, emotional eating, online assessment, subscription model, habit reshaping, client outcomes, men''s health, hair restoration, at-home diagnostics, vitamins, online consultations, direct-to-consumer, UK market, personalized health, scientific research, proactive wellness.', 'https://joinvoy.com', 'https://www.linkedin.com/company/joinvoy/', 'https://storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/05/24/6f1682951c6f404dfe770ac6587328a9.png', 'https://app.dealroom.co/companies/voy_5', 'London', 'United Kingdom', 51.5219, -0.0810638, 'Life sciences|Health Platform|Health|Wellness Beauty|Weight Management|Health and Wellness|Telemedicine|Metabolism|Direct-to-Consumer|Sustainable Development Goals|Mentech|Tech for P